      "updated_at": "2026-08-14T17:03:50Z",
      "body": "i added this 2 ENV variables \n\nDOCKER_HOSTNAMES = 192.168.5.28,192.168.5.11\n\nDOCKER_PORTS = 2375,2375\n\nHomarr is on Raspbery Pi 192.168.5.28 and another docker instance is on separate HW on 192.168.5.11 (Ubuntu)\n\nOn both instances i also have this docker proxy:\n\nservices:\n  dockerproxy:\n    image: tecnativa/docker-socket-proxy\n    container_name: dockerproxy\n    environment:\n      - CONTAINERS=1   \n      - SERVICES=1     \n      - IMAGES=1       \n      - INFO=1         \n      - PING=1         \n      - VERSION=1     \n      - POST=0         \n    ports:\n      - '2375:2375'\n    volumes:\n      - /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock:ro\n    restart: unless-stopped",
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "pin": null,
