      "body": "I tested combining DOCKER_SOCKET_PATHS and DOCKER_HOSTNAMES/DOCKER_PORTS (as well as DOCKER_ENDPOINTS). None of these create Docker integrations under Management -> Integrations in the current v2 test build. The Docker stats widget throws \"No integration data available\" because no Docker integration exists. Is there a specific ENV syntax needed for v2 to automatically expose multiple Docker hosts as separate integrations, or is this feature still pending implementation?",
